Alembic migration environment for raw SQL migrations against Supabase PostgreSQL.

Django handles ORM-level schema changes via its own migration system (manage.py migrate).
Alembic is used here for:
  - Custom SQL procedures, triggers, and views
  - Index tuning migrations
  - Data migrations that are easier to express in raw SQL

Usage:
  alembic revision -m "add_weekly_summary_view"   # new migration
  alembic upgrade head                             # apply all pending
  alembic downgrade -1                             # roll back one step
  alembic current                                  # show current revision
  alembic history                                  # list all revisions
